  "notes": "This version was released in a folded white cardboard cover, with artwork printed directly on the cover. There is also a version [url=https://www.discogs.com/X-Los-Angeles/release/9801296]here[/url] that was released in a heavy cardboard cover with pasted on cover slicks.\n\nIncludes two-sided black and white printed inner sleeve with lyrics and band photo. Some copies include an ad for Slash Records artists' t-shirts.\n\nRecorded in January 1980 @ Golden Sound Studios, Hollywood, CA.\nPackage: J. Ruby Prods., Inc.\n\nPlated at Greg Lee Processing based on the etchings.\n\n© 1980 Slash Records.\n℗ 1980 Slash Records.\n\nRunouts are etched.",
